 ## 16. Parity plan
 
-L3 is out of scope. A reimplementation is judged on RL-1 through RL-6. **RL-4 is the one that cannot
-be discovered from the data**: the ownership of a resource is a property of the caller, so a port
-that decides it from the file — the only place a reader would look — is wrong for every caller at
-once.
